            <!-- 2. Key Idioms -->
            <div class="section-title">💬 2. التعبيرات الاصطلاحية الأساسية (Key Idioms)</div>
            <p class="section-hint">مصطلحات شائعة في اللغة الإنجليزية وامتحانات الثانوية العامة مع أمثلتها المنهجية الكاملة:</p>
            <div class="cards-grid grid-cards" style="margin-bottom: 35px;">
    
                <div class="card" onclick="playSound('click')" style="border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-orange);">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div>
                            <span class="tag-badge" style="background: rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.2); color: var(--accent-orange);">Idiom</span>
                            <div class="word-en">go the extra mile</div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="audio-btn" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); speakText('go the extra mile'); playSound('click');" title="نطق المصطلح">🔊</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <strong style="color: var(--accent-orange);">المعنى:</strong> يتفانى في العمل - يقوم بأكثر مما يطلب منه
                        <div class="simple-explain-box" style="direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-top: 8px;">
                            <strong>= </strong> to try harder and do more than what is needed.
                        </div>
                        <div style="background: rgba(19, 27, 46, 0.6); padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #cbd5e1; direction: ltr; text-align: left;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">e.g.</strong> Ahmed didn&#x27;t just study the lessons for his final exams; he solved extra past papers and attended revision sessions. He really went the extra mile to achieve top grades.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
        
                <div class="card" onclick="playSound('click')" style="border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-orange);">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div>
                            <span class="tag-badge" style="background: rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.2); color: var(--accent-orange);">Idiom</span>
                            <div class="word-en">no pain, no gain</div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="audio-btn" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); speakText('no pain, no gain'); playSound('click');" title="نطق المصطلح">🔊</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <strong style="color: var(--accent-orange);">المعنى:</strong> من جد وجد (لا حلاوة بدون نار)
                        <div class="simple-explain-box" style="direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-top: 8px;">
                            <strong>= </strong> You can&#x27;t achieve success or improvement without hard work, effort, or difficulty.
                        </div>
                        <div style="background: rgba(19, 27, 46, 0.6); padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #cbd5e1; direction: ltr; text-align: left;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">e.g.</strong> Yara woke up early every day during Thanaweya Amma to revise her subjects. She believed that no pain, no gain, and her hard work paid off in the end.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
        
                <div class="card" onclick="playSound('click')" style="border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-orange);">
