                            <div class="word-en">spring / jump into action</div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="audio-btn" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); speakText('spring / jump into action'); playSound('click');" title="نطق المصطلح">🔊</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <strong style="color: var(--accent-orange);">المعنى:</strong> يتصرف بسرعة - يبدأ العمل على الفور
                        <div class="simple-explain-box" style="direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-top: 8px;">
                            <strong>= </strong> To suddenly begin working or responding quickly.
                        </div>
                        <div style="background: rgba(19, 27, 46, 0.6); padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #cbd5e1; direction: ltr; text-align: left;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">e.g.</strong> When the teacher announced a surprise quiz, the students quickly jumped into action and started revising their notes.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
        
