                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 move on (phr.) <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(ينتقل لعمل/نشاط/موضوع جديد - يواصل (بدون مفعول))</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            I had to finish the tasks in hand before I moved on.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;">
                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 move on to (phr.) <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(ينتقل للقيام بـ ... (+ مفعول))</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            I had to finish the tasks in hand before moving on to the new one.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="note-card" style="background: rgba(19, 27, 46, 0.85); border: 1px solid var(--accent-orange); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 22px;">
                <div class="note-header" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.3); padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
                    <div class="note-title-en" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-orange);">⚡ 3. rise - raise - arise - arouse</div>
                    <div class="note-title-ar" style="font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8;">المقارنة الرباعية الأشهر في قواعد الثانوية العامة</div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
        
                    <div style="background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;">
                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 rise - rose - risen (v) <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(فعل لازم لا يأخذ مفعولاً (تشرق للشمس / يرتفع / ينهض))</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            The sun rises at 6 a.m. • Prices have risen lately. • I rose from my chair to welcome my guests.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;">
                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 raise - raised - raised (v) <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(فعل متعدٍ يأخذ مفعولاً (يرفع / يجمع مالاً / يربي أطفالاً))</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            Mr Hussein raised his arm. • This charity raises money for homeless children. • Parents work hard to raise their children.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;">
                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 arise - arose - arisen (v) <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(فعل لازم لا يأخذ مفعولاً (ينشأ - يحدث = happen, occur, take place))</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            Problems arise every now and then.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;">
                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 arouse - aroused - aroused (v) <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(فعل متعدٍ يأخذ مفعولاً (يثير - يسبب مشاعر أو ردود أفعال = cause a feeling, reaction))</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            The way she talks arouses laughter.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="note-card" style="background: rgba(19, 27, 46, 0.85); border: 1px solid var(--accent-orange); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 22px;">
                <div class="note-header" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.3); padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
                    <div class="note-title-en" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-orange);">⚡ 4. spring vs spring into action</div>
                    <div class="note-title-ar" style="font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8;">يقفز مقابل يهب للعمل بسرعة</div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
        
                    <div style="background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;">
                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 spring - sprang - sprung (v) = jump <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(يقفز مباغتة)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            Ahmed sprang out of bed and ran to the kitchen.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;">
                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 spring into action <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(يتصرف بسرعة - يبدأ التحرك فوراً)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            As the man was badly injured, the doctors sprang into action.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                </div>
            </div>
        
            <div class="note-card" style="background: rgba(19, 27, 46, 0.85); border: 1px solid var(--accent-orange); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 22px;">
                <div class="note-header" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.3); padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
                    <div class="note-title-en" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-orange);">⚡ 5. full vs filled vs fulfilled</div>
                    <div class="note-title-ar" style="font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8;">مليء مقابل ممتلئ مقابل شاعر بالرضا والقناعة</div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
        
                    <div style="background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;">
                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 full of (adj.) = filled with <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(مليء بـ)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            This young man is full of energy.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;">
                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 filled with (adj.) <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(مملوء بـ)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            This bottle is filled with tap water.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                    <div style="background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px;">
                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem;">
                            🔹 fulfilled (adj.) <span style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">(شاعر بالرضا أو القناعة التامة)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 6px; direction: ltr; text-align: left; padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;">
                            After finishing the task, Sama was tired but fulfilled.
                        </div>
                    </div>
            
                </div>
            </div>
        
        </div>
    
        
