    <script>
        window.lessonData = {
            id: "sec3_unit1_lesson1_2",
            title: "Sec 3 - Unit 1: Inside the World of Care (Lessons 1 & 2)",
            storyPages: [
                {
                    title: "Scene 1: Morning Coffee & Mental Preparation",
                    imageUrl: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene1.webp",
                    caption: "Nurse Sarah mentally preparing for her demanding 12-hour hospital shift with morning coffee",
                    textEn: "Every morning, Nurse Sarah kicks off her day with a strong cup of coffee before her 12-hour shift begins. She is always preparing herself mentally for the challenges ahead.",
                    textAr: "في كل صباح، تستهل الممرضة سارة يومها بفنجان قوي من القهوة قبل أن تبدأ نوبتها الممتدة لـ 12 ساعة. وهي تُعد نفسها دائماً ذهنياً لمواجهة التحديات المقبلة.",
                    vocabNotes: "(1) kicks off (يبدأ - ينطلق) • 12-hour shift (نوبة 12 ساعة) • mentally (ذهنياً) • challenges ahead (التحديات المقبلة)"
                },
                {
                    title: "Scene 2: Checking Charts & A Buzzing Hospital",
                    imageUrl: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene2.webp",
                    caption: "Sarah reviewing patient charts at the nurses' station amidst a buzzing hospital morning",
                    textEn: "As soon as she arrives, she checks patients' charts and reviews updates from the night shift. The hospital is buzzing with activity – doctors rushing, monitors beeping, and patients waiting.",
                    textAr: "وبمجرد وصولها، تتفقد ملفات المرضى وتراجع تحديثات نوبة الليل. ويضج المستشفى بالنشاط والحركة - أطباء يسارعون الخطى، وأجهزة مراقبة تصدر صفارات التنبيه، ومرضى في الانتظار.",
                    vocabNotes: "arrives (تصل) • (2) charts (ملفات المرضى) • reviews updates (تراجع التحديثات) • night shift (نوبة الليل) • (3) buzzing (يضج بالنشاط) • (4) rushing (يسارع الخطى) • (5) beeping (يصدر صفارات)"
                },
                {
                    title: "Scene 3: Administering Medication & Caring for Mr. Ramy",
                    imageUrl: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene3.webp",
                    caption: "Sarah administering medication and comforting elderly patient Mr. Ramy recovering from surgery",
                    textEn: "Sarah's first task is administering medication to her patients. Some have been waiting anxiously, while others are resting quietly. She has cared for many patients over the years, but each day brings new surprises. One elderly patient, Mr. Ramy, has been recovering from surgery and needs extra attention. Sarah makes sure he is comfortable before moving on.",
                    textAr: "كانت مهمة سارة الأولى هي إعطاء الأدوية لمرضاها. كان بعضهم ينتظر بقلق، بينما كان آخرون يستريحون في هدوء. لقد اعتنت بالكثير من المرضى على مدار السنين، غير أن كل يوم يحمل مفاجآت جديدة. كان أحد المرضى المسنين، السيد رامي، يتعافى من عملية جراحية ويحتاج إلى عناية إضافية. تأكدت سارة من شعوره بالراحة قبل أن تنتقل إلى مريض آخر.",
                    vocabNotes: "(6) administering (يعطي دواء) • (7) medication (أدوية) • anxiously (بقلق) • (8) recovering from (يتعافى من) • (9) surgery (جراحة) • extra attention (عناية إضافية) • (10) moving on (ينتقل إلى)"
                },
                {
                    title: "Scene 4: Midday Emergencies & Teamwork in Action",
                    imageUrl: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene4.webp",
                    caption: "Emergencies arise: the medical team springs into action rushing an accident victim to the ER",
                    textEn: "By midday, emergencies arise – a car accident victim is rushed in, and the team springs into action. Sarah assists the doctors, ensuring everything runs smoothly. Despite the chaos, she remains calm and focuses on her duties. “Teamwork makes the dream work,” she often says, relying on her colleagues for support.",
                    textAr: "بحلول الظهيرة، تنشأ حالات طوارئ - حيث يُنقل ضحية حادث سيارة على عجل، وينطلق الفريق الطبي للعمل بسرعة. تساعد سارة الأطباء، وتتأكد من سير كل شيء بسلاسة. وعلى الرغم من الفوضى، تظل هادئة وتركز على واجباتها. وكثيراً ما تقول: \"العمل الجماعي يحقق النجاح المنشود\"، معتمدة على زملائها للحصول على الدعم.",
                    vocabNotes: "(11) emergencies (حالات الطوارئ) • (12) arise (يبدأ - ينشأ) • victim (ضحية) • (13) springs into action (ينطلق للعمل) • (14) assists (يساعد) • (15) ensuring (يتأكد) • (16) chaos (فوضى) • (17) focuses on (يركز على) • (18) relying on (يعتمد على) • (19) colleagues (زملاء)"
                },
                {
                    title: "Scene 5: Documenting Patient Progress & Evening Check",
                    imageUrl: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene5.webp",
                    caption: "Sarah documenting each patient's medical progress at the desk by evening",
                    textEn: "By evening, Sarah has checked on all her patients and has documented their progress. She feels exhausted but fulfilled.",
                    textAr: "بحلول المساء، تكون سارة قد اطمأنت على جميع مرضاها ووثقت تقدمهم الصحي. تشعر بالإرهاق لكنها تشعر بالرضا والامتلاء الداخلي.",
                    vocabNotes: "checked on (اطمأنت على) • (20) documented (يوثق - يسجل) • (21) progress (تقدم - تحسن) • exhausted (مرهقة) • (22) fulfilled (راضٍ - قانع)"
                },
                {
                    title: "Scene 6: Heading Home & A Rewarding Vocation",
                    imageUrl: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene6.webp",
                    caption: "Heading home after a 12-hour shift: nursing is a rollercoaster, but truly rewarding",
                    textEn: "As she heads home, she reflects on the day – some moments were heartbreaking, but many were rewarding. Nursing is a never-ending rollercoaster, but Sarah wouldn't trade it for anything.",
                    textAr: "وبينما تتجه إلى منزلها، تتأمل في أحداث اليوم - بعض اللحظات كانت مفجعة ومؤلمة، لكن الكثير منها كان مجزياً ومُرضياً. التمريض بمثابة أفعوانية مليئة بالتقلبات الشديدة التي لا تنتهي، لكن سارة لن تستبدل مهنتها بأي شيء في العالم.",
                    vocabNotes: "heads home (تتجه للمنزل) • (23) reflects on (يتأمل - يمعن التفكير) • (24) heartbreaking (مؤلم - محزن) • (25) rewarding (مجزي - مرضٍ) • (26) rollercoaster (به تقلبات شديدة) • wouldn't trade it for anything (لن تستبدلها بأي شيء)"
                }
            ],
            quiz: [{"emoji": "💊", "question": "1. The nurse's first daily duty was to ________ prescribed medication to her patients.", "options": [{"text": "administer", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "admit", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "admire", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "adopt", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "أحسنت! administer medication = يعطي أو ينظم الدواء (+10)", "wrongMsg": "خطأ! الفعل الصحيح هو administer."}, {"emoji": "🚑", "question": "2. Mazen is a ________ of his bad health habits and lack of sleep.", "options": [{"text": "victim", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "view", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "value", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "villain", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "إجابة نموذجية! Mazen is a victim (ضحية) للعادات السيئة (+10)", "wrongMsg": "ركز! الكلمة المطلوبة هي victim (ضحية)."}, {"emoji": "⚡", "question": "3. When the emergency call arrived, the surgical team quickly ________ into action.", "options": [{"text": "sprang", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "spelled", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "spilt", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "split", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "رائع! sprang into action = هب للعمل وتصرف بسرعة (+10)", "wrongMsg": "حاول مجدداً! الماضي من spring into action هو sprang into action."}, {"emoji": "💔", "question": "4. Hearing about the tragic loss of the young patient was deeply ________.", "options": [{"text": "heartbreaking", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "heartwarming", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "harmless", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "hopeless", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "بطل! heartbreaking = محزن جداً ومؤلم (+10)", "wrongMsg": "ركز! heartbreaking تعني محزن جداً."}, {"emoji": "🌟", "question": "5. Volunteering to help disabled children is an extremely ________ and fulfilling experience.", "options": [{"text": "rewarding", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "rewardless", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "fruitless", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "harmful", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "ممتاز! rewarding = مجزٍ ومرضٍ للنفس (+10)", "wrongMsg": "خطأ! rewarding تعني عمل يمنح شعوراً بالرضا."}, {"emoji": "🎢", "question": "6. Life in the trauma intensive care unit is an emotional ________ of highs and lows.", "options": [{"text": "rollercoaster", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "ferris wheel", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "merry-go-round", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "cable car", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "صحيح! rollercoaster = موقف متأرجح وتقلبات شديدة (+10)", "wrongMsg": "حاول ثانية! rollercoaster تعني تقلبات حادة."}, {"emoji": "🫀", "question": "7. The paramedic placed her fingers gently on the patient's wrist to check his ________.", "options": [{"text": "pulse", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "purse", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "pause", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "phase", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "أحسنت! pulse = النبض (+10)", "wrongMsg": "ركز! pulse تعني النبض."}, {"emoji": "🫁", "question": "8. When a person's heart stops beating, trained responders immediately perform ________.", "options": [{"text": "CPR", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "GPS", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "MRI", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "DNA", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "إجابة ممتازة! CPR = الإنعاش القلبي الرئوي (+10)", "wrongMsg": "حاول ثانية! CPR تعني الإنعاش القلبي الرئوي."}, {"emoji": "🌪️", "question": "9. During the mass-casualty incident, the waiting hall was in complete ________.", "options": [{"text": "chaos", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "order", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "harmony", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "peace", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "بطل! chaos = فوضى عارمة (+10)", "wrongMsg": "خطأ! chaos تعني فوضى."}, {"emoji": "⏰", "question": "10. Nurses in emergency departments often work a demanding 12-hour ________.", "options": [{"text": "shift", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "shaft", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "sheet", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "short", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "رائع! shift = وردية أو نوبة عمل (+10)", "wrongMsg": "ركز! وردية العمل هي shift."}, {"emoji": "🏃‍♂️", "question": "11. Ahmed always solves extra past exam papers; he truly goes the ________.", "options": [{"text": "extra mile", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "extra meter", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "extra yard", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "extra inch", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "ممتاز! go the extra mile = يتفانى في العمل ويقوم بأكثر مما ينبغي (+10)", "wrongMsg": "المصطلح المنهجي هو: go the extra mile."}, {"emoji": "💪", "question": "12. Yara studied tirelessly for Thanaweya Amma because she believed: 'No ________, no gain.'", "options": [{"text": "pain", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "pan", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "plan", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "pen", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "صحيح! No pain, no gain = من جد وجد / لا حلاوة بدون نار (+10)", "wrongMsg": "المثل هو: No pain, no gain."}, {"emoji": "🤝", "question": "13. In modern hospitals, 'teamwork makes the ________ work' is a vital motto.", "options": [{"text": "dream", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "drama", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "drum", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "dress", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "أحسنت! Teamwork makes the dream work = العمل الجماعي يحقق الحلم (+10)", "wrongMsg": "المصطلح الصحيح: Teamwork makes the dream work."}, {"emoji": "💎", "question": "14. Sarah loves her nursing vocation so much that she wouldn't ________ it for anything.", "options": [{"text": "trade", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "trend", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "treat", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "track", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "ممتاز! wouldn't trade it for anything = يعتبره أثمن ما يملك (+10)", "wrongMsg": "المصطلح الصحيح: wouldn't trade it for anything."}, {"emoji": "🔄", "question": "15. What is the synonym of the word 'administer' in a medical context?", "options": [{"text": "dispense or give", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "consume or swallow", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "refuse or reject", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "prevent or stop", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "إجابة دقيقة! مرادف administer هو dispense أو give (+10)", "wrongMsg": "مرادف administer هو give / dispense."}, {"emoji": "🔀", "question": "16. Which of the following is an antonym for 'chaos'?", "options": [{"text": "order and harmony", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "disorder and disruption", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "confusion and turmoil", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "hazard and panic", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "رائع! عكس chaos هو order أو harmony (+10)", "wrongMsg": "مضاد chaos هو order / harmony."}, {"emoji": "☀️", "question": "17. The sun ________ in the east every morning at dawn.", "options": [{"text": "rises", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "raises", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "arises", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "arouses", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "صحيح! rise فعل لازم يُستخدم مع شروق الشمس (+10)", "wrongMsg": "شروق الشمس يأخذ الفعل اللازم rises."}, {"emoji": "🙋‍♂️", "question": "18. The student ________ his hand politely to ask the teacher a question.", "options": [{"text": "raised", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "rose", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "arose", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "aroused", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "ممتاز! raise فعل متعدٍ يأخذ مفعولاً (raised his hand) (+10)", "wrongMsg": "رفع اليد يتطلب فعلاً متعدياً: raised."}, {"emoji": "⚠️", "question": "19. Unexpected complications may ________ during complex open-heart surgery.", "options": [{"text": "arise", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "raise", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "arouse", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "rise", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "بطل! arise = تنشأ / تحدث (تأتي مع المشكلات والظروف) (+10)", "wrongMsg": "تنشأ المشكلات = problems arise."}, {"emoji": "😄", "question": "20. The comedian's clever jokes ________ great laughter in the entire theater.", "options": [{"text": "aroused", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "arose", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "risen", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "rose", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "رائع! arouse = يثير أو يسبب مشاعر وردود أفعال (+10)", "wrongMsg": "إثارة المشاعر والضحك = arouse."}, {"emoji": "⚽", "question": "21. What time does the Thanaweya Amma revision session ________ this Friday?", "options": [{"text": "kick off", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "kick away", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "kick down", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "kick over", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "أحسنت! kick off = يبدأ أو ينطلق (+10)", "wrongMsg": "يبدأ وينطلق = kick off."}, {"emoji": "🏢", "question": "22. The new clinic is finally furnished; the doctors will move ________ next Monday.", "options": [{"text": "in", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "into", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "on to", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "away from", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "ممتاز! move in تأتي بدون مفعول عند الانتقال لمقر جديد (+10)", "wrongMsg": "بدون مفعول نستخدم: move in."}, {"emoji": "🏥", "question": "23. The medical team will move ________ the new building tomorrow morning.", "options": [{"text": "into", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "in", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "on", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "away", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "صحيح! move into + مفعول (the new building) (+10)", "wrongMsg": "مع وجود مفعول نستخدم: move into."}, {"emoji": "➡️", "question": "24. After finishing the patient's vitals, the nurse moved ________ to check on Mr. Ramy.", "options": [{"text": "on to", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "away from", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "into", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "in", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "رائع! move on to + موضوع أو مهمة جديدة (+10)", "wrongMsg": "الانتقال لمهمة جديدة = move on to."}, {"emoji": "😊", "question": "25. Despite being physically exhausted after the 12-hour shift, Sarah felt completely ________.", "options": [{"text": "fulfilled", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "full of", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "filled with", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "filling", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "ممتاز! fulfilled = شاعر بالرضا التام والقناعة الإنسانية (+10)", "wrongMsg": "الشعور بالرضا والامتلاء النفسي = fulfilled."}, {"emoji": "🥤", "question": "26. The water bottle was ________ fresh water from the dispenser.", "options": [{"text": "filled with", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "fulfilled", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "full in", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "fully", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "صحيح! filled with = ممتلئ بـ (+10)", "wrongMsg": "التعبير الصحيح: filled with."}, {"emoji": "⚡", "question": "27. The young medical intern is energetic and ________ enthusiasm for learning.", "options": [{"text": "full of", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "fulfilled", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "fill by", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "fills", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "أحسنت! full of enthusiasm = مليء بالحماس (+10)", "wrongMsg": "مليء بالحيوية = full of."}, {"emoji": "🤕", "question": "28. The elderly patient was recovering ________ major abdominal surgery.", "options": [{"text": "from", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "for", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "at", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "with", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "رائع! recover from = يتعافى من مرض أو جراحة (+10)", "wrongMsg": "يتعافى من = recover from."}, {"emoji": "💭", "question": "29. As she drove home, Sarah ________ on the day's heartbreaking and rewarding events.", "options": [{"text": "reflected", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "relied", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "responded", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "rescued", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "بطل! reflect on = يفكر ويتأمل في (+10)", "wrongMsg": "يتأمل في مجريات اليوم = reflect on."}, {"emoji": "🚑", "question": "30. When the ambulance arrived, the paramedics ________ over the emergency care.", "options": [{"text": "took", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "held", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "made", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "gave", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "ممتاز! take over = يتولى المسؤولية والمهمة (+10)", "wrongMsg": "يتولى المهمة = take over."}, {"emoji": "👂", "question": "31. Good students are always ________ in class and listen carefully to instructions.", "options": [{"text": "attentive", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "inattentive", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "attention", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "attending", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "أحسنت! attentive = منتبه ومنصت (+10)", "wrongMsg": "الصفة بمعنى منتبه هي attentive."}, {"emoji": "😴", "question": "32. The injured driver lost ________ for ten minutes following the collision.", "options": [{"text": "consciousness", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "conscious", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "unconscious", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "conscience", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "رائع! lost consciousness = فقد وعيه (+10)", "wrongMsg": "فقد الوعي = lost consciousness."}, {"emoji": "📰", "question": "33. That shocking news report had an attention-________ headline.", "options": [{"text": "grabbing", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "grabbed", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "grabs", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "grab", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "ممتاز! attention-grabbing headline = عنوان جاذب وخاطف للانتباه (+10)", "wrongMsg": "التعبير هو attention-grabbing."}, {"emoji": "🛡️", "question": "34. Unfair social practices often lead to the ________ of innocent people.", "options": [{"text": "victimization", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "victim", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "victimize", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "victimized", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "بطل! victimization = الاضطهاد والتعرض للظلم (+10)", "wrongMsg": "الاسم الدال على الاضطهاد هو victimization."}, {"emoji": "📱", "question": "35. In the emergency call, what did the neighbor do when the patient wasn't breathing?", "options": [{"text": "Started performing CPR", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Gave him a hot drink", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Left him alone to rest", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Walked away from the scene", "isCorrect": false}], "correctMsg": "ممتاز! بدأ فوراً في إجراء الإنعاش القلبي الرئوي (CPR) (+10)", "wrongMsg": "النص يوضح أنه بدأ إجراء CPR فوراً."}]
        };

        // Inline Exercise Answer Checker
        function checkInlineAnswer(button, isCorrect, feedbackMsg) {
            const card = button.closest('.card');
            if (!card) return;
            const buttons = card.querySelectorAll('button.action-btn');
            buttons.forEach(b => b.disabled = true);
            const feedbackBox = card.querySelector('.inline-feedback');
            if (isCorrect) {
                button.style.background = 'var(--accent-green)';
                button.style.color = '#0b0f19';
                button.style.borderColor = 'var(--accent-green)';
                if (feedbackBox) {
                    feedbackBox.style.display = 'block';
                    feedbackBox.style.color = 'var(--accent-green)';
                    feedbackBox.innerHTML = '🌟 ' + feedbackMsg;
                }
                if (typeof window.playSound === 'function') window.playSound('correct');
            } else {
                button.style.background = 'var(--accent-red)';
                button.style.color = '#ffffff';
                button.style.borderColor = 'var(--accent-red)';
                if (feedbackBox) {
                    feedbackBox.style.display = 'block';
                    feedbackBox.style.color = 'var(--accent-red)';
                    feedbackBox.innerHTML = '❌ ' + feedbackMsg;
                }
                if (typeof window.playSound === 'function') window.playSound('wrong');
            }
        }

        // Sequential Dialogue Playback Engine
        let dialogueUtterance = null;
        let isDiagPlaying = false;
        let currentDiagIndex = 0;
        const dialogueTurns = [{"id": "diag-turn-0", "speaker": "Operator (مستجيب الطوارئ 123)", "role": "operator", "text": "123, what's your emergency?", "translation": "123، ما هي حالة الطوارئ لديكم؟", "badge": "🚨 Emergency Call Line"}, {"id": "diag-turn-1", "speaker": "Caller (المتصل)", "role": "caller", "text": "My neighbor has collapsed! He was walking downstairs when he suddenly grabbed his chest and fell down. I have never seen him like this before!", "translation": "جاري قد انهار وسقط أرضاً! كان ينزل الدرج عندما أمسك بصدره فجأة وسقط. لم أره قط في هذه الحالة من قبل!", "badge": "⚡ collapsed • grabbed • chest"}, {"id": "diag-turn-2", "speaker": "Operator (مستجيب الطوارئ 123)", "role": "operator", "text": "Have you checked his pulse?", "translation": "هل تفقدت نبضه؟", "badge": "🩺 Pulse Check"}, {"id": "diag-turn-3", "speaker": "Caller (المتصل)", "role": "caller", "text": "His pulse has been checked, but he hasn't been breathing, so CPR has been started. His wife said he complained about chest pain earlier, and his medication hadn't been taken.", "translation": "لقد تم فحص نبضه، لكنه لا يتنفس، ولذلك بدأنا في إجراء الإنعاش القلبي الرئوي (CPR). وقالت زوجته إنه اشتكى من ألم في الصدر في وقت سابق، ولم يتناول دواءه.", "badge": "❤️ CPR • complained • medication"}, {"id": "diag-turn-4", "speaker": "Operator (مستجيب الطوارئ 123)", "role": "operator", "text": "Hold on... Help is being sent. Has he regained consciousness?", "translation": "انتظر معي على الخط... النجدة في طريقها إليك الآن. هل استعاد وعيه؟", "badge": "⏳ Hold on • consciousness"}, {"id": "diag-turn-5", "speaker": "Caller (المتصل)", "role": "caller", "text": "No! By the time the ambulance has arrived, I'll try again.", "translation": "كلا! وإلى حين وصول سيارة الإسعاف، سأحاول مجدداً.", "badge": "🚑 Waiting for Ambulance"}, {"id": "diag-turn-6", "speaker": "Operator (مستجيب الطوارئ 123)", "role": "operator", "text": "Don't worry. The ambulance is on the way already and the paramedics will take over the situation.", "translation": "لا تقلق. سيارة الإسعاف في طريقها بالفعل، وسيتولى المسعفون زمام الموقف فور وصولهم.", "badge": "🛡️ Paramedics • take over"}];

        function speakDiagTurn(idx, btn) {
            if (dialogueTurns && dialogueTurns[idx]) {
                if (typeof window.speakText === 'function') {
                    window.speakText(dialogueTurns[idx].text, btn);
                }
            }
        }

        function toggleDialoguePlayAll() {
            if (isDiagPlaying) {
                stopDialoguePlayAll();
            } else {
                startDialoguePlayAll();
            }
        }

        function startDialoguePlayAll() {
            if (!('speechSynthesis' in window)) return;
            window.speechSynthesis.cancel();
            isDiagPlaying = true;
            currentDiagIndex = 0;
            const btn = document.getElementById('dialoguePlayAllBtn');
            if (btn) {
                btn.innerHTML = '⏸️ إيقاف القراءة المتتابعة (Stop)';
                btn.classList.add('playing');
            }
            playDiagStep(0);
        }

        function stopDialoguePlayAll() {
            isDiagPlaying = false;
            if (window.speechSynthesis) window.speechSynthesis.cancel();
            const btn = document.getElementById('dialoguePlayAllBtn');
            if (btn) {
                btn.innerHTML = '▶️ تشغيل المحادثة كاملة بالتتابع';
                btn.classList.remove('playing');
            }
            document.querySelectorAll('.dialogue-box').forEach(b => b.style.boxShadow = 'none');
        }

        function playDiagStep(idx) {
            if (!isDiagPlaying || idx >= dialogueTurns.length) {
                stopDialoguePlayAll();
                return;
            }
            currentDiagIndex = idx;
            document.querySelectorAll('.dialogue-box').forEach(b => b.style.boxShadow = 'none');
            const turn = dialogueTurns[idx];
            const box = document.getElementById(turn.id);
            if (box) {
                box.style.boxShadow = '0 0 15px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.4)';
                box.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });
            }
            dialogueUtterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(turn.text);
            dialogueUtterance.lang = 'en-US';
            dialogueUtterance.rate = 0.92;
            dialogueUtterance.onend = () => {
                if (!isDiagPlaying) return;
                setTimeout(() => {
                    playDiagStep(idx + 1);
                }, 700);
            };
            dialogueUtterance.onerror = () => {
                stopDialoguePlayAll();
            };
            window.speechSynthesis.speak(dialogueUtterance);
        }

        // Grammar slides and gallery presentation are managed by slides-engine.js

        
        // Linked Expression Photos Gallery Controller (Sec 3 Engine)
        const expressionsData = [
            {
                id: 1,
                en: "a set period of time",
                ar: "فترة محددة من الوقت / مدة معينة",
                img: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene1_nurse_sarah.webp",
                explain: "فترة محددة ومعروفة البداية والنهاية، كنوبة عمل متواصلة (مثل وردية الـ 12 ساعة في المستشفى).",
                exampleEn: "Doctors and nurses in Cairo work for <strong style='color: var(--accent-primary);'>a set period of time</strong> before handing over to the night team.",
                exampleAr: "يعمل الأطباء والتمريض في القاهرة لفترة محددة من الوقت قبل تسليم النوبة للفريق الليلي."
            },
            {
                id: 2,
                en: "aware of",
                ar: "مدرك لـ - على علم بـ",
                img: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene3_emergency_team.webp",
                explain: "الانتباه والوعي الكامل بالخطر أو الموقف والتعامل معه بحذر وفطنة.",
                exampleEn: "Emergency doctors must be fully <strong style='color: var(--accent-primary);'>aware of</strong> the patient's critical condition upon arrival.",
                exampleAr: "يجب أن يكون أطباء الطوارئ على دراية كاملة بحالة المريض الحرجة فور وصوله."
            },
            {
                id: 3,
                en: "due to",
                ar: "بسبب / ناتج عن",
                img: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene4_documenting_progress.webp",
                explain: "تأتي لبيان السبب ويتبعها اسم (Noun) أو (V+ing) وتساوي (because of / owing to).",
                exampleEn: "The patient made a quick recovery <strong style='color: var(--accent-primary);'>due to</strong> excellent medical care and attentive nurses.",
                exampleAr: "تماثل المريض للشفاء السريع بسبب الرعاية الطبية الممتازة والممرضات المخلصات."
            },
            {
                id: 4,
                en: "make sure",
                ar: "يتأكد / يحرص على التيقن",
                img: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene2_patient_care.webp",
                explain: "التحقق المباشر من سلامة الإجراء أو راحة الشخص قبل المضي قدماً.",
                exampleEn: "Sarah always <strong style='color: var(--accent-primary);'>makes sure</strong> that elderly patient Amm Ramy feels comfortable after his surgery.",
                exampleAr: "تحرص سارة دائماً على التأكد من راحة المريض المسن عم رامي بعد الجراحة."
            },
            {
                id: 5,
                en: "rewarding work",
                ar: "عمل مرضٍ ومجزٍ / رسالة سامية",
                img: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene5_patient_care_vocation.webp",
                explain: "عمل يمنح صاحبه شعوراً بالفخر والسعادة والإشباع الداخلي رغم مشقته، كمهنة الطب والتمريض.",
                exampleEn: "Nursing in Egyptian public hospitals is demanding but truly <strong style='color: var(--accent-primary);'>rewarding work</strong>.",
                exampleAr: "إن التمريض في المستشفيات المصرية مجهد لكنه عمل مجزٍ ومرضٍ للغاية."
            },
            {
                id: 6,
                en: "ups and downs",
                ar: "أفراح وأحزان - تقلبات الحياة",
                img: "./sec 3 storybook photos/sec3_u1_scene6_rollercoaster_vocation.webp",
                explain: "تعبير اصطلاحي شهير يعني الأوقات الجيدة والسيئة المتلاحقة (تقلبات المزاج أو ظروف العمل).",
                exampleEn: "Hospital life has its <strong style='color: var(--accent-primary);'>ups and downs</strong>, but saving lives makes every moment worthwhile.",
                exampleAr: "لحياة المستشفى تقلباتها بين السراء والضراء، لكن إنقاذ الأرواح يجعل كل لحظة ذات قيمة."
            }
        ];

        window.expressionsData = expressionsData;

        // Clean cache and sync with story-engine.js and slides-engine.js
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            for (let i = 1; i <= 6; i++) {
                localStorage.removeItem('sec3_u1_scene_' + i);
            }
            if (window.storyEngine && window.lessonData && window.lessonData.storyPages) {
                window.storyEngine.loadPages(window.lessonData.storyPages);
            }
        });

